                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "c1QqSo",
                      "fill": "#2D3748",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 240,
                      "content": "Liat temen yang start-nya bareng sekarang posisinya udah tinggi banget. Apa karena keluargaku dari awal emang kurang mampu ya? Rasanya kok berat banget ngejarnya.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "tZGIp",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 8,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Bu0g5",
                  "fill": "#FFFFFF",
                  "padding": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "eXuiw",
                      "fill": "#2D3748",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 240,
                      "content": "Ngerasa tertinggal itu berat banget rasanya. Tapi ingat, setiap orang punya lintasan larinya masing-masing. Suara yang membanding-bandingkan ini biasanya ulah Si Cermin. Jangan biarkan dia bikin kamu kecil hati. Yuk, kita redakan Si Cermin di Riung.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "Inter",
                      "fontSize": 14,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
